      "updated": 1775744103433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Questions + Notes:\n1. What kind of storage should I have? Supabase DB?\n2. Need a tool to get founder emails\n3. Should probably consider making distrubuted services instead\n    of all in one\n4. when i am working with a value in real time like for example\n    when i have a company that I want to grab the tags, website data, etc\n    for and work with it then how does that work? do i just define variables\n    in the automated bot flow and then it does it?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Questions + Notes:\n1. What kind of storage should I have? Supabase DB?\n2. Need a tool to get founder emails\n3. Should probably consider making distrubuted services instead\n    of all in one\n4. when i am working with a value in real time like for example\n    when i have a company that I want to grab the tags, website data, etc\n    for and work with it then how does that work? do i just define variables\n    in the automated bot flow and then it does it?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
